• Normal quality audio (up to 96kbps);
• Save your favourite releases, tracks and playlists to your music library;
• Create your own playlists;
• Subscribe to your favourite DJs to get informed of new releases;
• Search for music among the many presented styles.

Premium Subscription features for Listeners:
• High quality audio (up to 320kbps);
• Unlimited skips;
• Rewind;
• Download and listen offline;
• No ad.

Pro Subscription features for DJs:
• Upload your releases and view detailed statistics;
